<div id="sbs-flow" class="sbs-flow">
 <div class="sbs-flow-next" role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong id="sbs-flow-next-title">Next: choose artwork</strong><p id="sbs-flow-next-detail">Follow the numbered sections below.</p><button id="sbs-flow-next-button" class="sbs-button primary" type="button">Go to Step 1</button></div>
 <nav class="sbs-flow-nav" aria-label="Artwork finishing steps"><button type="button" data-flow-go="1">1. Choose artwork</button><button type="button" data-flow-go="2">2. Check artwork</button><button type="button" data-flow-go="3">3. Fix action list</button><button type="button" data-flow-go="4">4. Upscale and prepare</button><button type="button" data-flow-go="5">5. Final check</button><button type="button" data-flow-go="6">6. Transfer files</button></nav>
 <div id="sbs-flow-step-1" class="sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="1"><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Not started</p></div>
 <section id="sbs-flow-step-2" class="sbs-card sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="2"><h2 tabindex="-1">2. Check the artwork</h2><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Not checked</p><p>Checks the file, whole artwork, close-up details and saved rules. Zoom is available without upscaling.</p><div id="sbs-flow-inspect"></div><label for="sbs-flow-character">Character reference — optional<select id="sbs-flow-character"><option value="">No character selected</option></select></label><div id="sbs-flow-notes"></div><details><summary>Saved checks for all artwork</summary><label for="sbs-flow-rules">One check per line<textarea id="sbs-flow-rules" rows="5" maxlength="10000"></textarea></label><button id="sbs-flow-rules-save" class="sbs-button" type="button">Save these checks</button><p id="sbs-flow-rules-status" role="status"></p></details><button id="sbs-flow-check" class="sbs-button primary" type="button" disabled>Check artwork and make action list</button><p>Visual checks use OpenAI and may use credits. They include your instructions and saved rules.</p><p id="sbs-flow-check-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose artwork first.</p></section>
 <div id="sbs-flow-step-3" class="sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="3"><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Waiting for the check</p><div id="sbs-flow-actions"><h3>Artwork action list</h3><p id="sbs-flow-actions-status" role="status">The artwork check will list possible problems here.</p><ol id="sbs-flow-list"></ol><button id="sbs-flow-recheck" class="sbs-button" type="button" disabled>Check the corrected artwork again</button></div><p id="sbs-flow-repair-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="sbs-flow-resume" class="sbs-button" type="button" hidden>Resume repair check</button><button id="sbs-flow-cancel" class="sbs-button" type="button" hidden>Cancel the waiting action</button><button id="sbs-flow-accept-pixels" class="sbs-button" type="button" hidden>Keep remaining print effects / marks as intentional</button></div>
 <section id="sbs-flow-step-4" class="sbs-card sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="4"><h2 tabindex="-1">4. Upscale and prepare the print file</h2><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Waiting for corrections</p><p id="sbs-flow-size-status">Correct the artwork first. Enlargement uses the selected corrected version.</p><div id="sbs-flow-size-actions"></div></section>
 <div id="sbs-flow-step-5" class="sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="5"><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Waiting for the print file</p><button id="sbs-flow-final-pixels" class="sbs-button" type="button" disabled>Optional: check possible print issues</button></div>
 <section id="sbs-flow-step-6" class="sbs-card sbs-flow-step" data-flow-step="6"><h2 tabindex="-1">6. Approve and transfer your files</h2><p class="sbs-flow-status" role="status">Waiting for final checks</p><div id="sbs-flow-save-actions"></div><label for="sbs-flow-prefix">Two-letter artwork prefix<input id="sbs-flow-prefix" type="text" maxlength="2" minlength="2" pattern="[A-Za-z]{2}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="sbs-flow-prefix-help"></label><p id="sbs-flow-prefix-help">Suggested from the artwork title. The Drive folder starts with this prefix, then the title and version. No date is put at the beginning.</p><button id="sbs-flow-drive" class="sbs-button primary" type="button" disabled>Transfer approved files to Smutty Bear Drive</button><button id="sbs-flow-connect" class="sbs-button" type="button">Connect Smutty Bear Google Drive</button><p id="sbs-flow-drive-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Studio transfers each artwork and inspection file individually, verifies the uploads, then updates the main Drive production register.</p><a id="sbs-flow-drive-link" class="sbs-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open artwork folder in Drive</a><a id="sbs-flow-register-link" class="sbs-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open production register</a></section>
</div>
<div id="sbs-flow-preview" class="sbs-af-correction-dialog" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sbs-flow-preview-title"><header class="sbs-af-correction-head"><h2 id="sbs-flow-preview-title">Review the local repair</h2><button id="sbs-flow-preview-close" class="sbs-button" type="button">Close</button></header><p>Compare the two images. Keep the preview only if the intended problem improved.</p><div class="sbs-flow-preview-pair"><figure><figcaption>Before</figcaption><img id="sbs-flow-before" alt="Artwork before local repair"></figure><figure><figcaption>Repair preview</figcaption><img id="sbs-flow-after" alt="Proposed local repair"></figure></div><button id="sbs-flow-keep" class="sbs-button primary" type="button">Keep repair as a new version</button><button id="sbs-flow-reject" class="sbs-button" type="button">Reject repair — keep previous image</button><p id="sbs-flow-preview-status" role="status"></p></div>
